  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with scvi_n200 RNA encoder, resnet50 image encoder, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion (config_033) achieve the highest validation accuracy (0.713). This experiment tests replacing resnet50 with imagenet_vit_l image encoder while keeping the same RNA encoder, aggregation, and fusion method. This isolates the impact of the image encoder choice, a critical design decision, to determine if a more advanced encoder improves performance. It balances exploitation of the current top-performing setup with exploration of key components."
}

